& [SpecificationJustificationSolution]
  + source states the executable intention and exclusions without rewriting the user's direction
  + canonical IAPL-001 through IAPL-008 and IAPL-018 through IAPL-022 already govern policy READY projection stopping and reentry
  + readiness review delineates provider-free advancement from provider-attributed IterationRecord evidence
  + the solution seam is one isolated deterministic record result validator and driver family over the already proven compact kernel

& [DualHemisphereReview]
  + holistic reading preserves the purpose: a compact attention procedure can pause be inspected resume and terminate without semantic drift
  + analytic reading requires exact handles closed types bounded calls exclusive outcomes and mutation-refusing validation
  + the two readings reconcile only if the stepper returns executable state evidence while claiming neither model inference nor external truth

& [FacultyReview]
  + Honesty requires READY stopped and terminal claims to remain mutually distinct and forbids fabricated provider evidence
  + Security requires registry validation exact compare-and-set inputs and retained successor identity
  + Planner requires positive bounded quotas a finite call cap and explicit stop state
  + Weaver requires ordered zero-based records and predecessor-to-successor continuity
  + Scribe requires exact compact responses terminal observation and public nonclaims
  + Refiner requires projections instead of repeated checkpoint bodies and no redundant provider-shaped fields
  + Observer admits only results satisfying every prior boundary and the focused acceptance suite

& [Decision]
  + activate Slice2 deterministic provider-free stepping and validation
  + permit focused fixtures normalized serialization measurement and local bounded verification
  + keep Slice3 provider protocol and every network process persistence effect hidden-state remote EVO-X2 OneDrive FPGA and Minecraft path locked

& [Rollback]
  + no schema migration or existing P0 behavior changes are required
  + the new isolated forms exports and tests can be removed together if acceptance fails
